      "introText": "There are occasional minor and major challenges in daily life that can constantly reoccur, to which one can sometimes not get used to, and which can be more or less burdensome. Please tick whether and how strongly you have been affected by the following annoyances or inconveniences OVER THE PAST MONTH.",
